["https://spdx.org/rdf/3.1/terms/Hardware/Dimensions", "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#note", "Dimensions generally refer to measurable extents or attributes that define the size, shape, or scale of an object, system, or concept. The Z axis is the height of the object.", "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString", "en", ""]
