["https://spdx.org/rdf/3.1/terms/Software/SbomType/design", "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment", "SBOM of intended, planned software project or product with included components (some of which may not yet exist) for a new software artifact.", "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString", "en", ""]
