["https://spdx.org/rdf/3.1/terms/Core/Regulation", "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#note", "The Regulation class represents any rules or directives enforced by an official authority.\nRegulations within this class can be either mandatory or voluntary.\n\nExamples of these regulations include the EU Radio Equipment Directive, EU Cyber Resilience Act,\nthe Japan Cyber STAR, or the U.S. Cyber Trust Mark.", "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString", "en", ""]
