["https://spdx.org/rdf/3.1/terms/SupplyChain/ResponsibilityType/ownership", "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment", "Ownership refers to the legal right to control, manage, and benefit from an asset, resource, or responsibility. It establishes authority, accountability, and entitlements over something, whether it's property, a business, intellectual property, or responsibilities.", "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString", "en", ""]
["https://spdx.org/rdf/3.1/terms/Core/RelationshipType/finetunedOn", "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type", "https://spdx.org/rdf/3.1/terms/Core/RelationshipType", "globalId", "", ""]
["https://spdx.org/rdf/3.1/terms/Software/Sbom", "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#note", "A Software Bill of Materials (SBOM) is a collection of SPDX Elements describing\na single package.\n\nThis could include details of the content and composition of the product,\nprovenance details of the product and/or its composition, licensing\ninformation, known quality or security issues, etc.", "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString", "en", ""]
