["https://spdx.org/rdf/3.1/terms/Core/RelationshipType/packagedBy", "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition", "Every to Element is a packaged instance of the from Element (from packagedBy to).", "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString", "en", ""]
