["https://spdx.org/rdf/3.1/terms/Core/postOfficeBoxNumber", "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#note", "A postal box (P.O. Box) is a secure, numbered mailbox located at a post office or mail facility, used to receive mail. It provides a fixed mailing address, independent of a physical home or business location.", "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString", "en", ""]
