["https://spdx.org/rdf/3.1/terms/Core/devLifecycleStage", "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition", "The product lifecycle phase, the requirement is applicable for.", "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString", "en", ""]
["https://spdx.org/rdf/3.1/terms/Security/SsvcDecisionType/attend", "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition", "The vulnerability requires attention from the organization's internal, supervisory-level individuals. Necessary actions include requesting assistance or information about the vulnerability, and may involve publishing a notification either internally and/or externally. CISA recommends remediating Attend vulnerabilities sooner than standard update timelines.", "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString", "en", ""]
