["https://spdx.org/rdf/3.1/terms/FunctionalSafety/VerificationType/demonstration", "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition", "Demonstrating and monitoring or recording that the item under verification to confirm that a requirement is met by the item under verification.", "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString", "en", ""]
