["https://spdx.org/rdf/3.1/terms/AI/metricDecisionThreshold", "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#note", "Each metric can be computed based on a decision threshold.\n\nFor instance, precision or recall is typically computed by checking if the\nprobability of the outcome is larger than 0.5.\n\nEach decision threshold shall match with a metric field defined in the AI\npackage.", "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString", "en", ""]
