["https://spdx.org/rdf/3.1/terms/SupplyChain/CreateProcess", "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#note", "The creation process refers to the systematic steps involved in bringing something new into existence. This can apply to products, ideas, businesses, art, software, and even life itself.\n\nRelationship:\n\nFor every CreateProcess, there exists at least one /Core/Relationship\nclass or subclass with a relationshipType of 'hasOutput',\nconnecting the CreateProcess (from)\nto a /Core/Element class or subclass (to).", "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString", "en", ""]
