["https://spdx.org/rdf/3.1/terms/Core/countyCode", "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition", "A code that identifies a county.", "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString", "en", ""]
["https://spdx.org/rdf/3.1/terms/Software/SbomType/analyzed", "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition", "SBOM generated through analysis of artifacts (e.g., executables, packages, containers, and virtual machine images) after its build. Such analysis generally requires a variety of heuristics. In some contexts, this may also be referred to as a \"3rd party\" SBOM.", "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString", "en", ""]
